Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.00,Title,,0,0,0,,TIME-ZONE TRAVELERS // REVIEW PROOF
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.00,Footer,,0,0,0,,Non-public approval render. Public posting blocked until Daniel approves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Tokyo or Seoul for your first\Nnight-owl city trip? Do not ask\Nwhich city is better. Ask which\Ncity forgives beginner mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:10.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Tokyo rewards planning. IC cards\Nmake movement smooth, but the\Nnetwork is layered across many\Noperators. Seoul rewards quick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:17.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Choose Tokyo if your dream is\Ndense visual culture, iconic\Ndistricts, and a route you plan\Nbefore leaving the hotel. Choose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:24.00,Body,,0,0,0,,For either city, your first win\Nis not a hidden attraction. It is\Nlanding with a transit card plan,\None backup route, and a carry-on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:30.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Time-Zone Travelers verdict:\NTokyo is the cinematic maze.\NSeoul is the flexible night\Nroute. Pick the mistake pattern
